			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 750190301,
					"content": "…这件事没有商讨的余地吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "曼科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190302,
					"content": "我说，曼科老兄啊，你没有听蒂图兄弟说过吗，这事情已经快五百多年没人干过啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕加尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190303,
					"content": "就算你说，找到了可能的入口…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕加尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190304,
					"content": "那又如何，历史中，踏上这条路的人和他们的伙伴，全都没有回来，听好了，是「一个」都没有。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕加尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190305,
					"content": "呃，恕我直言…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "曼科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190306,
					"content": "那个龙遗物研究协会的家伙在那里，旁边的那一位，好像是「回声之子」的首领？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190307,
					"content": "喂…龙遗物研究协会的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190308,
					"content": "#是{NICKNAME}…派蒙，还有{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "曼科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190309,
					"content": "呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190310,
					"content": "喔哦，尾巴上绑红丝巾的小嵴锋龙！好有精神的小家伙，看上去就感觉不太一样呢，来，再来一下！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕加尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190311,
					"content": "呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190312,
					"content": "#真不错，你就是{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}，那么，你们两个就是{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}选择的勇者了吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕加尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190313,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}和派蒙，你们的名字最近出现的很频繁啊…不仅曼科老兄一直在念叨，蒂图那家伙回部族的时候也提到过。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕加尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190314,
					"content": "你们的最近的事迹，都已经可以算是「传说故事」啦，而且，回声之子的小家伙们也受到你很多的照顾。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190315,
						750190316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕加尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190315,
					"content": "不用太感激我。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190317
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750190317,
					"content": "哈哈，了不起的年轻人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕加尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190318,
					"content": "曼科老兄，为了验证你的想法，就要把他们推进火坑，这可不是回声之子的待客之道。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190319
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕加尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190319,
					"content": "至少这不是「我的」待客之道，我可干不出这样的事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕加尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190320,
					"content": "唉…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190321
					],
					"speakerTitle": "曼科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190321,
					"content": "你们在说什么啊，什么危险啊，火坑的？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190322
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190322,
					"content": "抱歉，这就请让我来进行说明吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190323
					],
					"speakerTitle": "曼科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190323,
					"content": "还记得之前说的吗，为了解除「焰主之祝」的标记，需要带着必须的两种信物前往火山。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190324
					],
					"speakerTitle": "曼科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190324,
					"content": "其中一个信物就在回声之子外的遗迹…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190325
					],
					"speakerTitle": "曼科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190325,
					"content": "只不过想要进入那里也有条件。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190326
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕加尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190326,
					"content": "根据过往的惯例…当然了，这个惯例还是我刚刚翻织物找到的，毕竟很长时间没有人还想做这样的事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190327
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕加尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190327,
					"content": "（test）弄得我头发上全是灰尘，走在路上的时候还被搭话，「老大，你今天怎么看上去还老了十岁…」，咳咳，这个不说了…（废弃）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190328
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕加尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190328,
					"content": "如果想要带自己的龙伙伴前往火山，进行洗礼，洗去「焰主之祝」，就得从各自部族首领那里取得认可…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190329
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕加尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190329,
					"content": "(test)方能踏上取得信物之一的朝圣之道。（废弃）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190330
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕加尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190330,
					"content": "(test)嗯？（废弃）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190331
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190331,
					"content": "(test)欸，什么叫从各自部族首领那里取得证明啊…（废弃）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190332
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190332,
					"content": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}是只小嵴锋龙，所以就要取得「回声之子」首领的承认。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190333
					],
					"speakerTitle": "曼科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190333,
					"content": "#(test)原来是这样，我们家的{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}是只小嵴锋龙，所以就要取得「回声之子」首领的认可…（废弃）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190334
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190334,
					"content": "呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190335
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190335,
					"content": "那不就是帕加尔先生的认可嘛。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190336
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190336,
					"content": "#是啊，不过说实话，这个规矩到底能不能对不是部族人的异邦人有效，我也不知道…但是，{NICKNAME}…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190337
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕加尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190337,
					"content": "这几百年内，为了让自己的龙伙伴从这个血脉中的…比起祝福更像是诅咒一样的东西逃脱的勇士有很多。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190338
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕加尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190338,
					"content": "但是没有一个人成功…这也是后来部族里逐渐荒弃了这一传统的缘由…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190339
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕加尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190339,
					"content": "欸，居然没有一个人能成功吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190340
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190340,
					"content": "对，就是这么危险的事，而且，据说在取得信物前的试炼里，不仅是决定前往的勇士，就连龙伙伴本身都会受到考验…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190341
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕加尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190341,
					"content": "虽然你们并不是部族人，但我还是不希望你们白白送死。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190342
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕加尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190342,
					"content": "#所以，{NICKNAME}，我还是提议，把{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}留在回声之子吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190343
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕加尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190343,
					"content": "至少我可以保证，在它进入夜神的国度之前，我会好好照顾好它。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190344
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕加尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190344,
					"content": "可是，可是这样的话…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190345
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190345,
					"content": "#…就像我之前说的，{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}就没法长大了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190346
					],
					"speakerTitle": "曼科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190346,
					"content": "呜…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190347
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190347,
					"content": "看来它不是很希望这样呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190348
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750190348,
					"content": "我想试试看。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190349
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750190349,
					"content": "即使很危险，也想要试试看吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190350
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕加尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190350,
					"content": "嗯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190351
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750190351,
					"content": "小家伙，你呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190352
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕加尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190352,
					"content": "呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190353
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190353,
					"content": "哈哈哈，真好，无比坚定的眼神，坚硬，却能够感受到内心的火热，真是犹如燃素岩一般的好家伙们。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190354
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕加尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190354,
					"content": "好啊，那我就承认你们有前往火山朝圣的资格吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190355
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕加尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190355,
					"content": "呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190356
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190356,
					"content": "好耶，现在我们是不是就可以去找第一个信物了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190357
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190357,
					"content": "不，还不行。既然已经取得资格，就要进行见证人的试炼…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190358
					],
					"speakerTitle": "曼科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190358,
					"content": "按照古老的传统，勇者与龙，必须一起取得树林深处绿咬鹃的羽毛，献上一打兽皮…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190359
					],
					"speakerTitle": "曼科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190359,
					"content": "必须一同为部族赢得五十场对外战斗的胜利，献上九十六颗品质上等的宝石…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190360,
						750190361
					],
					"speakerTitle": "曼科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190360,
					"content": "我没有资格…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190362
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750190362,
					"content": "算了，曼科老兄，你说的都是哪一年的老石历了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190363
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕加尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190363,
					"content": "那些本来就是为了培养龙和人的默契，增强他们的实力，才必须遵守的繁文缛节——我已经受够那些啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190364
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕加尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190364,
					"content": "#更何况，{NICKNAME}和{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}，看上去可并不需要用那些东西进行证明。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190365
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕加尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190365,
					"content": "#换种简单点的方法吧…{NICKNAME}，在纳塔，人们在遇到这种情况的时候有一种最方便快捷的办法——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190366
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕加尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190366,
					"content": "来和我打一场，向我证明你和你伙伴的实力吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190367
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕加尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190367,
					"content": "正合我意！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190368
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750190368,
					"content": "呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190369
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190369,
					"content": "咦，要在这里开打吗…啊，难道要去舞台上打？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190370
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190370,
					"content": "当然不是，哈哈，舞台可没办法钻来钻去的…回声之子的决斗场地在后山上。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190371
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕加尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190371,
					"content": "来吧，我们去后山上痛痛快快地打一场吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "帕加尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 750190361,
					"content": "能折成摩拉吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190362
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750190316,
					"content": "（test）只是举手之劳罢了。（废弃）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750190317
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7501906,
